      "summaries": {
        "en": "Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills is a structured library of 754 cybersecurity skills for AI agents, mapped to five major frameworks including MITRE ATT&CK and NIST CSF 2.0. Its key innovation is the agentskills.io standard, which defines skills as composable, framework-aligned capabilities that agents can execute autonomously. Practitioners can integrate it with Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, or 20+ other platforms to automate tasks like incident response, malware analysis, or cloud security audits, making it a practical toolkit for AI-driven security operations.",
        "zh": "Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills 是一个为 AI 智能体设计的结构化网络安全技能库，包含 754 项技能，并映射到 MITRE ATT&CK、NIST CSF 2.0 等五大安全框架。其核心创新在于 agentskills.io 标准，将技能定义为可组合、与框架对齐的能力单元，使智能体能自主执行安全任务。开发者可将其集成到 Claude Code、GitHub Copilot 等 20 多个平台中，用于自动化事件响应、恶意软件分析、云安全审计等场景。这套工具让 AI 不仅理解安全知识，更能直接参与安全运营，是构建智能安全助手的基础组件。",
        "es": "Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills is a structured library of 754 cybersecurity skills for AI agents, mapped to five major frameworks including MITRE ATT&CK and NIST CSF 2.0. Its key innovation is the agentskills.io standard, which defines skills as composable, framework-aligned capabilities that agents can execute autonomously. Practitioners can integrate it with Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, or 20+ other platforms to automate tasks like incident response, malware analysis, or cloud security audits, making it a practical toolkit for AI-driven security operations.",
        "sections": {
