      "summaries": {
        "en": "Presenton is an open-source AI presentation generator that creates professional slides from simple text prompts, serving as a free alternative to tools like Gamma. Its core strength lies in a modular architecture that separates content generation from slide rendering, allowing users to customize templates and integrate via API. You can use it to quickly generate presentations for meetings, classrooms, or client pitches, or extend it to build your own presentation automation workflow.",
        "zh": "Presenton 是一个开源的人工智能演示文稿生成器，能从简单的文本提示自动创建专业幻灯片，是 Gamma 等工具的免费替代方案。其核心设计亮点在于将内容生成与幻灯片渲染解耦，通过模块化架构支持自定义模板和 API 集成。你可以用它快速生成会议、课堂或客户提案的演示文稿，也可以基于其 API 构建自己的演示自动化工作流，非常适合需要批量生成或定制化演示的场景。",
        "es": "Presenton is an open-source AI presentation generator that creates professional slides from simple text prompts, serving as a free alternative to tools like Gamma. Its core strength lies in a modular architecture that separates content generation from slide rendering, allowing users to customize templates and integrate via API. You can use it to quickly generate presentations for meetings, classrooms, or client pitches, or extend it to build your own presentation automation workflow.",
