      "summaries": {
        "en": "LongLive is an infrastructure framework for generating long, high-quality videos with AI models. It introduces NVFP4, a 4-bit floating-point quantization technique that reduces memory usage and speeds up inference without sacrificing quality. The system also uses parallel processing to handle extended video sequences efficiently. Developers can use LongLive to build real-time video generation applications, such as interactive storytelling or dynamic content creation, by leveraging its optimized pipeline for long-form video synthesis.",
        "zh": "LongLive 是一个专为长视频生成设计的基础设施框架，解决了现有模型难以高效生成连贯长视频的难题。其核心技术NVFP4采用4位浮点量化，大幅降低显存占用和计算延迟，同时保持生成质量；结合并行处理机制，能够流畅处理超长视频序列。开发者可直接利用LongLive构建实时视频生成应用，例如交互式故事创作或动态广告生成，其优化管线让长视频合成变得高效可行。",
        "es": "LongLive is an infrastructure framework for generating long, high-quality videos with AI models. It introduces NVFP4, a 4-bit floating-point quantization technique that reduces memory usage and speeds up inference without sacrificing quality. The system also uses parallel processing to handle extended video sequences efficiently. Developers can use LongLive to build real-time video generation applications, such as interactive storytelling or dynamic content creation, by leveraging its optimized pipeline for long-form video synthesis.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "LongLive stands out for infra, long, and nvfp4 in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "LongLive is an infrastructure framework for generating long, high-quality videos with AI models. It introduces NVFP4, a 4-bit floating-point quantization technique that reduces memory usage and speeds up inference without sacrificing quality. The system also uses parallel processing to handle extended video sequences efficiently. Developers can use LongLive to build real-time video generation applications, such as interactive storytelling or dynamic content creation, by leveraging its optimized pipeline for long-form video synthesis.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/NVlabs/LongLive for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
