      "summaries": {
        "en": "BGE-Small-ZH-v1.5 is a compact Chinese text embedding model from BAAI, designed to convert sentences into dense vectors for semantic search and retrieval. Its key innovation is using Matryoshka Representation Learning, which allows the embedding dimension to be flexibly truncated without retraining, balancing accuracy and efficiency. You can use it with sentence-transformers for tasks like document retrieval, clustering, or as a backbone for RAG pipelines, especially in resource-constrained environments.",
        "zh": "BGE-Small-ZH-v1.5 是北京智源人工智能研究院推出的轻量级中文文本嵌入模型，用于将句子转换为稠密向量，支持语义搜索与检索任务。其核心技术采用套娃式表征学习，允许嵌入维度灵活截断而无需重新训练，兼顾精度与效率。模型体积小、推理快，适合移动端或边缘设备等资源受限场景。可通过 sentence-transformers 库调用，用于文档检索、文本聚类或检索增强生成（RAG）流水线。同时支持通过文本嵌入推理服务部署到云端，兼容 Azure 等平台，便于集成生产系统。",
        "es": "BGE-Small-ZH-v1.5 is a compact Chinese text embedding model from BAAI, designed to convert sentences into dense vectors for semantic search and retrieval. Its key innovation is using Matryoshka Representation Learning, which allows the embedding dimension to be flexibly truncated without retraining, balancing accuracy and efficiency. You can use it with sentence-transformers for tasks like document retrieval, clustering, or as a backbone for RAG pipelines, especially in resource-constrained environments.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "bge-small-zh-v1.5 stands out for transformers, pytorch, and safetensors in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "BGE-Small-ZH-v1.5 is a compact Chinese text embedding model from BAAI, designed to convert sentences into dense vectors for semantic search and retrieval. Its key innovation is using Matryoshka Representation Learning, which allows the embedding dimension to be flexibly truncated without retraining, balancing accuracy and efficiency. You can use it with sentence-transformers for tasks like document retrieval, clustering, or as a backbone for RAG pipelines, especially in resource-constrained environments.",
